; PsiBoost 0.21 for the Psion Series 5mx, ROM 1.05(260). Early beta.
; Every program's serial port at 230400: the program, its helper, the UART
; driver (PBUART21.LDD, for the helper's reads of the UART's registers), the
; hook (PBHOOK20.LDD) and the recogniser that puts the hook back at start-up
; (PsiBoost.rdl). The recogniser always goes on the CF card (D:), whatever
; disk the rest goes on: take the card out and restart, and it is gone.
; Built by build.sh into build/pkg/.
&EN
#{"PsiBoost"},(0x01000A94),0,21,0
"psiboost.app"-"!:\System\Apps\PsiBoost\PsiBoost.app"
"psiboost.rsc"-"!:\System\Apps\PsiBoost\PsiBoost.rsc"
"psiboost.aif"-"!:\System\Apps\PsiBoost\PsiBoost.aif"
"psiboost.mbm"-"!:\System\Apps\PsiBoost\PsiBoost.mbm"
"pboostd.exe"-"!:\System\Apps\PsiBoost\pboostd.exe"
"pbuart21.ldd"-"!:\System\Libs\PBUART21.LDD"
"pbhook20.ldd"-"!:\System\Libs\PBHook20.ldd"
"psiboost.rdl"-"D:\System\Recogs\PsiBoost.rdl"
